Brand name hierarchy shape shapeshifter architect
title end

paragraph start
SHAPE is the primary name and the one every account, link and logo leads with. SHAPESHIFTER and ARCHITECT are secondary names, called faces, that sit under SHAPE and never replace it.
paragraph end

paragraph start
A face is a way of speaking and showing the work, not a separate business. Every face keeps the same monochrome look and the same logo, so a viewer who meets one face can find the others.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
SHAPE, primary name
SHAPESHIFTER, face
ARCHITECT, face
code end

